    {
      "path": "/Users/gracker/Library/Mobile Documents/iCloud~md~obsidian/Documents/Obsidian/DeepResearch/2026-07-01-android17-relaunch-mask-policies-deep-dive.md",
      "title": "Android 17 shouldRelaunchLocked 6 层掩码策略深度展开",
      "summary": "skipRelaunchConfigMask 实际是 7 层叠加：CONFIG_RESOURCES_UNUSED 直接 return false 后，(a)~(g) 六层叠加。DisplayCompatPolicy 是双路径策略（CATEGORY_GAME vs COMPUTER_CONTROL），PiP skip CONFIG_DENSITY 是显式无条件豁免。RecreateOnConfigChangePolicy 是反向剥离子（&=~recreateMask），需 SKIP_ACTIVITY_RECREATION_ON_CONFIG_CHANGE opt-in。ResourceOverlayPolicy 走 OverlayManagerInternal RPC + mLastReportedOverlayPathsToConstraintsMap 差分。",
